                  2585.0,
                  876.0
                ],
                "runs": [
                  {
                    "text": "• Use 3.3 V only; the new module is specified for 2.8–3.3 V.\n• Existing bare panel is documented exactly as built: LEDA directly to GPIO 13 and LEDK to GND.\n• Before duplicating the bare-panel wiring, verify backlight current is within GPIO limits.",
                    "style": {
                      "font_family": "Inter",
                      "font_style": "Regular",
                      "size": 15.0,
                      "tracking": 0.0,
                      "baseline_shift": 0.0,
                      "h_scale": 100.0,
